      "type": "SEALED_BOX",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "And the one everybody's scared of. Web components seal their HTML inside a shadow root, and in Selenium that meant JavaScript incantations. In Playwright, get by label just walks in. So does get by role. So does CSS. One exception though — XPath genuinely cannot see inside.",
